  m_Text: "Tap glass bottles (hover labels) to select.\nMeasure 5/10 ml \u2192 Pour
    into beaker.\n\nScience (sim):\nAgNO\u2083 + NaCl \u2192 AgCl (light-sensitive).\nFix
    before light, or it darkens.\n\n1) LIGHT OFF\n2) 10 ml A\n3) 10 ml B\n4) Wait
    ~5s\n5) 5 ml C\n6) LIGHT ON \u2192 glow"
